@startuml US_3_2_3_C2_Logica
title US 3.2.3 - Lógica de sessão

component AuthSvc as "AuthService"
component Storage as "localStorage auth_token\nuserAvatar"
component API as "AuthTestController"

AuthSvc --> Storage : load on init
AuthSvc --> API : GET /authtest/me (timeout 5s)
API --> AuthSvc : profile/401
AuthSvc --> Storage : save/clear user
AuthSvc --> Observers : loggedIn$ next

@enduml
